From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Felipe Paiva <felipe.paiva@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 00:40:59 +0400
Subject: [PATCH] s32x-carts

32X carts are drawn as one 32X cart in the retro bitmap renderer (ADR
0054), the same for every region: Sega Retro's Sega 32X cartridges page
says the shape differs from the Mega Drive's while the dimensions are
similar, that the design is the same in every region, and that there are
no end labels. So the cart keeps the Mega Drive size (seated at 240x164,
360x246 drawn) with rounded top corners, a groove under a top cap and the
ridged sides, and the label well below the cap. The plastic is black,
the Mega Drive black 0x26 0x24 0x2a; the yellow 32X band is on the label
art itself. A shell colour chosen in Config/cart_shell.txt still wins.

The outline and relief are ours (s32x_cart.svg, s32x_cart_detail.svg),
lit into s32x_neutral.png by examples/retro_neutrals.rs; every other
neutral regenerates byte for byte.
---
 crates/slot-ui/assets/retro/s32x_neutral.png | Bin 0 -> 128485 bytes
 crates/slot-ui/assets/s32x_cart.svg          |   3 +
 crates/slot-ui/assets/s32x_cart_detail.svg   |  57 +++++++++
 crates/slot-ui/examples/retro_neutrals.rs    |   4 +-
 crates/slot-ui/src/cart.rs                   |   6 +-
 crates/slot-ui/src/lib.rs                    |   4 +-
 crates/slot-ui/src/retro_cart.rs             |  19 ++-
 crates/slot-ui/src/retro_face.rs             |   4 +-
 crates/slot-ui/src/retro_shell.rs            |   3 +
 crates/slot-ui/tests/render_nes_shelves.rs   |   5 +-
 crates/slot-ui/tests/retro_bitmap.rs         |   5 +-
 crates/slot-ui/tests/s32x_cart.rs            | 117 +++++++++++++++++++
 12 files changed, 214 insertions(+), 13 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 crates/slot-ui/assets/retro/s32x_neutral.png
 create mode 100644 crates/slot-ui/assets/s32x_cart.svg
 create mode 100644 crates/slot-ui/assets/s32x_cart_detail.svg
 create mode 100644 crates/slot-ui/tests/s32x_cart.rs

diff --git a/crates/slot-ui/assets/retro/s32x_neutral.png b/crates/slot-ui/assets/retro/s32x_neutral.png
new file mode 100644
